reports to follow up on.

203
00:11:56.185 --> 00:11:57.553
Come on!

204
00:11:57.586 --> 00:11:59.288
-Holy shit, it's Teddy Lobo.
-What the fuck? Come on!

205
00:11:59.321 --> 00:12:01.390
