-You know who I am?

206
00:12:01.423 --> 00:12:03.258
I'm Teddy fucking Lobo!

207
00:12:03.292 --> 00:12:04.660
Yeah, I'm pretty sure.

208
00:12:04.693 --> 00:12:06.528
Don't do anything crazy,
Rebecca.

209
00:12:06.562 --> 00:12:07.896
